Material Icon Theme
===================

This directory contains a vendored snapshot of the static assets from
`material-icon-theme` version 5.35.0.

Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/material-icon-theme/v/5.35.0
Repository: https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme
License: MIT, copied in `LICENSE`.

Only the static VS Code file icon theme data is used by ThinkTerm:

- `dist/material-icons.json`
- `icons/*.svg`

ThinkTerm does not run the VS Code extension JavaScript.
